---
import Layout from '../../layouts/AfterLayout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy policy" description="Privacy policy of the fictional Campus Café teaching demo: no cookies, no tracking, no third-party services.">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Privacy policy</h1>
  <div class="mt-6 max-w-prose space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
    <p><strong>Note:</strong> this is a teaching demo, not a legally complete privacy policy.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">What this website does not do</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
      <li>No cookies, no local storage, no tracking or analytics.</li>
      <li>No third-party services: fonts, scripts and images are served from this server.</li>
      <li>No embedded maps or videos. External links are only followed when you click them.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Server logs</h2>
    <p>The hosting provider may log technical data (such as IP address and time of access) to operate the service securely.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
